@SeattleByNight.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5263

### Liveness
GET {{SeattleByNight.Api_HostAddress}}/health/live
Accept: application/json

###

### Readiness (requires PostgreSQL)
GET {{SeattleByNight.Api_HostAddress}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json

###

### Antiforgery token (use the returned token in X-XSRF-TOKEN for state-changing requests)
GET {{SeattleByNight.Api_HostAddress}}/api/antiforgery/token
Accept: application/json

###

### Register
POST {{SeattleByNight.Api_HostAddress}}/api/account/register
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{requestToken}}

{
  "email": "dev@seattlebynight.local",
  "username": "devuser",
  "password": "DevPassword1!"
}

###

### Login
POST {{SeattleByNight.Api_HostAddress}}/api/account/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{requestToken}}

{
  "login": "devuser",
  "password": "DevPassword1!"
}

###

### Current account
GET {{SeattleByNight.Api_HostAddress}}/api/account/me
Accept: application/json

###

### List characters
GET {{SeattleByNight.Api_HostAddress}}/api/characters
Accept: application/json

###

### Start or resume a play session
POST {{SeattleByNight.Api_HostAddress}}/api/play-session/start
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{requestToken}}

{
  "characterId": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa"
}

###

### Current room session
GET {{SeattleByNight.Api_HostAddress}}/api/play-session/current
Accept: application/json

###

### Renew activity
POST {{SeattleByNight.Api_HostAddress}}/api/play-session/activity
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{requestToken}}

###

### Logout (ends the play session)
POST {{SeattleByNight.Api_HostAddress}}/api/account/logout
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{requestToken}}
